{% extends "_base.txt.j2" %}
{% set kicker = "CROSS-FRAME BRIDGE EXPIRED" %}
{% set headline = "Bridge transfer didn't redeem in time: funds unlocked" %}
{% block body %}
Your cross-frame bridge transfer expired before it was redeemed on the
destination frame. The escrowed amount has been automatically unlocked
back to the source agent.

  Bridge transaction:  {{ bridge_tx_id }}
  Source agent:        {{ source_agent_did }}
  Source frame:        {{ source_frame_id }}
  Target frame:        {{ target_frame_id }}
  Amount:              {{ amount }} {{ frame_currency }}
  Expires at:          {{ expires_at or '-' }}
  Expired at:          {{ expired_at }}

Open bridge console: {{ registry_ui_url }}#/bridge

No action required: the source agent's balance has already been credited.
{% endblock %}
